# Hero portrait. The image is NOT in this repo (see .gitignore) — it is served
# from a URL, so the photo never reaches GitHub. Put the real URL in .env.local,
# which is gitignored, and in the host's environment variables when deploying.
#
# Google Drive, from an "anyone with the link" share: take FILE_ID out of the
# /file/d/<FILE_ID>/view URL. The /view URL itself is an HTML page and will not
# render in an <img>; use one of the direct-image forms:
#
#   https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/FILE_ID=w1200        (fastest, no redirect)
#   https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=FILE_ID&sz=w1200   (one redirect)
#   https://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&id=FILE_ID       (one redirect)
#
# Any other host works too — the hostname is added to next/image automatically.
# A local file in /public also works for development: /mohit-portrait.jpg
#
# Leave it blank and the hero renders its approved no-portrait layout.
NEXT_PUBLIC_PORTRAIT_URL=
